  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cd0f0ba9-33d5-4c16-821c-892cef71d0ca-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 101px;\" /></p><p>Here self inductances are in series&nbsp;but their mutual inductances are linked oppositely.</p><p>As the inductors connected are in series opposition, hence magnetic flux will be opposing each other. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></math></p>",
